  <LocalizationPair Name="%StarSystemImprovementCurioHangarDamageTitle">Intelligent Armory</LocalizationPair>
  <LocalizationPair Name="%StarSystemImprovementCurioHangarDamageDescription">Specializing weaponry to counter enemy defenses is an important part of all warfare, and while it cannot make completely adaptive armaments, this armory can outfit ships with advanced "intelligent weapons" able to eke out that little bit of extra impact necessary to turn around an engagement.</LocalizationPair>
  <LocalizationPair Name="%StarSystemImprovementCurioHangarDamageEffectOverride">+15% Damage on Constructed Ships</LocalizationPair>
  <LocalizationPair Name="%StarSystemImprovementUniqueCurioInvasionManpowerTitle">High-Impact Training Facilities</LocalizationPair>
