  <LocalizationPair Name="%PlanetImprovementManpower1Title">Recruitment Drives</LocalizationPair>
  <LocalizationPair Name="%PlanetImprovementManpower1Description">By seeking out the destitute, desperate and ostracized among the population, this initiative swells the ranks of the military. Once located, these individuals are then inducted into any one of the various army camps and military schools on the planet. These prospective candidates are housed, fed and given aid, which leads to a sense of gratitude, but also obligation. Through this recruitment, the government has created warriors for life, who will gladly fight tooth and nail to protect the only true stability they have ever known.</LocalizationPair>
  <LocalizationPair Name="%PlanetImprovementManpower2Title">Civilian Armories</LocalizationPair>
  <LocalizationPair Name="%PlanetImprovementManpower2Description">In times of crisis, these offices open up to willing participants of the wider public. By sidestepping typical training regimens of standard military recruitment, and stirring the hearts of the people in the face of adversity, citizens are able to conscript themselves into the empire's army faster than ever before. This process is often rushed and usually creates soldiers of lesser quality and experience, potentially leading to higher casualties, but the greater gains to military forces far outweighs any drawbacks.</LocalizationPair>
  <LocalizationPair Name="%PlanetImprovementManpower3Title">Subsidized Military Programs</LocalizationPair>
  <LocalizationPair Name="%PlanetImprovementManpower3Description">By providing soldiers with superior benefits and care for not only themselves, but also family members, the populace begins to view the military in a far more positive light. News of the state’s generosity spreads like wildfire across the planet, resulting in the rate of enrollment skyrocketing. This is performed in conjunction with greater campaigns and propaganda that invoke the desire to shield their loved ones and communities from all threats, both external and internal.</LocalizationPair>
  <LocalizationPair Name="%PlanetImprovementManpower4Title">Military Academies</LocalizationPair>
  <LocalizationPair Name="%PlanetImprovementManpower4Description">These grandiose institutions have but a singular goal, to study the art of war. Combat in all its forms are meticulously studied and optimised within the classrooms, laboratories and engineering offices of these illustrious establishments. By using the famed military accomplishments of renowned figures both living and historical, the younger generations are spurred on to follow in the footsteps of the greats, and perhaps even carve out their own legacy.</LocalizationPair>
  
